<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT LEICESTERSHIRE BY 84 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT LEICESTERSHIRE BY 84 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat</p>
<p>Leicestershire by 84 runs in their three-day cricket match which</p>
<p>ended on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 220-8 declared and 105-3 declared;</p>
<p>Leicestershire 62-4 declared and 179.</p>
</text>
